		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Golden-scaled cobra with the head of a human tucked within the cobra hood. Given to meditation and introspection, not strife.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 34, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +5 (2d6 + poison) and 1 spell +5, <strong>MV</strong> near (climb), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> L, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Bind (CHA Spell)</strong>. DC 13. One humanoid in far paralyzed 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Hypnotize (CHA Spell)</strong>. DC 13. Focus. One target in near range who can see naga is helplessly stupefied for duration.</p><p></p><p><strong>Null (CHA Spell)</strong>. Self. DC 15. Focus. Hostile spells targeting naga are DC 15 to cast.</p><p></p><p><strong>Poison</strong>. CON 15+ or paralyzed 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
